    "force_field": "ATLAS paper (Vander Meersche et al., Nucleic Acids Research 52, D384-D392, 2024, doi:10.1093/nar/gkad1084) states trajectories were run with GROMACS v2019.4, CHARMM36m (July 2020 version), TIP3P water, 150 mM NaCl. Charges used here are from the CHARMM36 July 2022 GROMACS port; CHARMM36m revises CMAP (backbone torsion correction) relative to CHARMM36 while standard-residue partial charges are unchanged, so the charge source matches. Histidine protonation (HSE vs HSD) cannot be decided from the stored data (no hydrogens); primary calculation used HSE, sensitivity check HSD, with the same shape."
